# PolyPets core

- **Repo:** `https://github.com/633Games/PolyPets` only. Never clone, link, or push `Shilo/PolyPet` or any other PolyPet fork.
- Unity **6.3 LTS** · URP · main scene `Assets/Scenes/House_LivingRoom.unity`
- Before broad search, read `.cursor/PROJECT_MAP.md` and `.cursor/KNOWN_ISSUES.md`
- Live Unity inspect/exec: use `.cursor/unity/Invoke-Unity.ps1` (skill `unity-bridge`) — not full `.unity` YAML, screenshots, or Editor.log
- Own code: `Assets/Scripts/Runtime/` and `Assets/Scripts/Editor/` — do not edit `Assets/Feel/` or commit `Library/`
- Design docs live in `docs/` — prefer them over inventing features
- After UI rebuilds, verify Shop + Feed + Play dock buttons are serialized on `CareHudController` (bridge `get-component`)
- Camera framing is user-owned: never force reframe unless `reframeOnStart` is true
- Soft shadows stay on; day/night must stay throttled
- Play target: **480×720**
- Commit only when asked; author **633Games**
